        IF `the party has considered amicable resolution of the dispute at the stage in question`
            THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "has the duty to consider amicable resolution of the party’s dispute before the commencement and during the course of any action or appeal"

